# Dependencies & build output (rebuilt inside the image)
node_modules
**/node_modules
**/.next
**/dist
**/coverage
**/.turbo
**/.cache

# VCS / IDE / local tooling
.git
.github
.cursor
.vscode
**/.DS_Store

# Secrets — inject at runtime via Compose env_file / orchestrator
.env
.env.*
!.env.example
apps/api/.env
apps/web/.env
apps/web/.env.local
apps/web/.env*.local

# Tests & reports (not needed to run the apps)
**/test
**/tests
**/*.spec.ts
**/*.e2e-spec.ts
playwright-report
test-results
apps/web/playwright.config.ts

# Docs / misc (keep Dockerfiles & compose in context via explicit paths)
**/*.md
!README.md

# Local agent / debug leftovers
**/.tmp-*
**/agent-transcripts
